{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "﻿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "﻿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "﻿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "﻿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "﻿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "﻿言葉にするには未練が多すぎるの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "﻿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/80a/f21983b3e5ef17ffe355cb00cc3cb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/80a/f21983b3e5ef17ffe355cb00cc3cb-01.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう1週間たつというのに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこの現場でも気配があるような気がしてしまって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はまだ、見送ることの正しさばかり考えています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "永遠なんてないことくらい､よく分かってるはずなのに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんかずっと一緒にいられる気がしてた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/80a/f21983b3e5ef17ffe355cb00cc3cb-02.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/images/46/80a/f21983b3e5ef17ffe355cb00cc3cb-03.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでも時間は進んでいきます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私には、強くなれないなんて言ってる暇はなくて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "向き合わなければいけないことがたくさん。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "結局"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久保さんのパフォーマンスは手の届かないままだし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久保さんみたいな説得力がついてくるほどの丁寧な人にはなれないけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はステージに立つみんなを肯定していたい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だってみんなのこと大好きだし、良いところもいっぱい知ってるし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それを伝える術を久保さんが教えてくれたから。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業おめでとうございますって晴れ晴れした顔で言えない私は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しおりさんが笑ってたらそれが1番嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱい幸せでいてください。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きます。"}], "source": "official"}